---
// "Two things your chatbot can't do alone" — the product's two hero demos,
// shown as annotated agent transcripts.
---

<section id="demos" aria-labelledby="demos-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">What it does</p>
      <h2 id="demos-title">Two things your chatbot can't do alone</h2>
      <p>
        A regular chatbot can't reach a paid data API or check out a real cart. With intendr, your
        agent pays for exactly what it needs — and never more than the cap.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="demo-grid">
      <!-- Demo 1: LinkedIn → verified email -->
      <article class="card demo">
        <div class="demo-top">
          <span class="demo-badge">Real data · $0.01</span>
          <h3>Fetch a real email from a LinkedIn URL</h3>
          <p class="demo-lede">
            A specific person Claude has no way to know. intendr pays a data provider one cent and
            returns the verified address.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="term" role="img" aria-label="Agent resolves a LinkedIn URL to a verified email for one cent">
          <div class="term-line">
            <span class="you">you</span>
            <span>find the email behind linkedin.com/in/aaron-…</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line">
            <span class="tool">search_services</span>
            <span class="dim">→ Orthogonal · email verification</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line">
            <span class="tool">pay_and_run</span>
            <span class="dim">reserve $0.01 → run → settle</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-out">
            <div class="kv"><span>email</span><b class="accent">demo@example.com</b></div>
            <div class="kv"><span>status</span><b>verified</b></div>
            <div class="kv"><span>charged</span><b>$0.01 · balance $49.99</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Demo 2: budget-aware purchase -->
      <article class="card demo">
        <div class="demo-top">
          <span class="demo-badge">Real commerce · scoped card</span>
          <h3>Buy the best product under a budget</h3>
          <p class="demo-lede">
            The agent finds the best match under your ceiling, previews the cart with tax, waits for
            your yes, then checks out on a single-use virtual card.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="term" role="img" aria-label="Agent buys the best weight scale under thirty dollars after approval">
          <div class="term-line">
            <span class="you">you</span>
            <span>buy me the best weight scale under $30</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line">
            <span class="tool">search_services</span>
            <span class="dim">→ INEVIFIT Digital Scale · $18.99</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line">
            <span class="tool">pay_and_run</span>
            <span class="warn">BLOCKED · needs approval</span>
          </div>
          <div class="term-out">
            <div class="kv"><span>cart</span><b>INEVIFIT scale + tax</b></div>
            <div class="kv"><span>total</span><b class="accent">$20.65</b></div>
            <div class="kv"><span>waiting</span><b>your approval to place</b></div>
          </div>
          <div class="term-line approve-line">
            <span class="you">you</span>
            <span>approved</span>
            <span class="tool">approve</span>
            <span class="ok">→ order placed · single-use card</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="demo-note">
          Safe default: purchases run on a test card — no real money — until the operator enables
          real virtual cards.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .demo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 26px;
  }
  .demo-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(198, 242, 78, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(198, 242, 78, 0.22);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .demo h3 {
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 25px);
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .demo-lede {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .term {
    margin-top: 20px;
    background: #0a0c0f;
    border: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 9px;
    flex: 1 1 auto;
  }
  .term-line {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .term-line .you {
    color: var(--accentInk);
    background: var(--accent);
    padding: 1px 7px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .term-line .tool {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .dim {
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .warn {
    color: var(--danger);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .ok {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .term-out {
    margin-top: 2px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-radius: 9px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .kv {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .kv span {
    color: var(--faint);
  }
  .kv b {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .approve-line {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .demo-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--hair);
    border-radius: 9px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }
</style>
